{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:05 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"「竣誠駒」在袁幸堯胯下升班作賽仍連捷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/4d0c30bded0f63fae087a07b23453157/2026-11/m2_8.jpg\"/><p>今季告東尼較慢熱，但踏入十一月即猛攻，賽前於本月已取六W；今晚練者續搶攻，於第三場勝出「竣誠駒」，此馬在袁幸堯胯下升班作賽仍可連捷。</p><p>馬主梁錫安說：「我要多謝馬會，『竣誠駒』出自香港國際拍賣會，至今六勝頭馬令我驚喜。上仗贏馬後，牠休息逾兩星期，告東尼把馬兒的狀態維持得很好。」</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:23:57.710841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T15:05:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T00:31:16.442793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:17:21.038347+00:00","content_hash":"bca694b199c2f455af86d3fb09f6c8ddec61308bf6cf93f28f06abf82e743936","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}